  "description": "记忆区：在 DSH 界面查看并编辑全局 AGENTS.md 与每个工作区的 AGENTS.md 记忆文件",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
